    "geometry": "not_activated",
    "reason": "The two official ENR endpoints expose the same complete 691-unit universe and support same-grain review. They remain explicitly unofficial and cannot receive the 194 certified President votes or 184 certified U.S. House votes without an official local canvass allocation."
